    {
      "id": "b-798",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `processVideo` - Processes the video and schedules transcription"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-799",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `getStorageUrl` - Gets a temporary URL for the video file"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-800",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `transcribeVideo` - Calls Deepgram API to generate transcription"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-801",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `updateTranscription` - Updates the video record with the transcription result"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-802",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `updateStatus` - Updates just the status field of a video"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-803",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Created Frontend Components**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-804",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `VideoTranscription` - Displays the transcription with appropriate loading states"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-805",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Video details page - Shows the video details and transcription"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-806",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Enhanced Workflow**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-807",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Upload video → Process video → Generate transcription"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-808",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Each step has error handling and retry logic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-809",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Status updates at each stage for frontend display"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-810",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Added Environment Variable**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-811",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `DEEPGRAM_API_KEY` for authentication with Deepgram"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-812",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How to Test"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-813",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Get a Deepgram API key from [deepgram.com](https://deepgram.com/)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-814",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Add your actual API key to `.env.local`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-815",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Deploy your changes to Convex with `npx convex deploy`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-816",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Upload a video through the UI"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-817",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Watch the status change as it processes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-818",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. View the transcription on the video details page"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-819",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Implementation Details"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-820",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The implementation follows best practices:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-825",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-821",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Error handling** at each step"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-822",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Retry logic** with exponential backoff"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-823",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Status updates** for user feedback"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-824",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Clear separation** between frontend and backend concerns"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-826",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Advantages Over Using Trigger.dev"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-827",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "By implementing this directly in Convex:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-828",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Simplified Architecture** - Everything in one place"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-829",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Reduced Complexity** - No extra services to manage"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-830",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Built-in Scheduling** - Used Convex's scheduler for retries and sequencing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-831",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Transactional Safety** - Database updates and scheduling are atomic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-832",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If your transcription needs grow more complex in the future (e.g., handling very long videos or adding multiple AI processing steps), you can always integrate Trigger.dev later, but this solution should handle most common use cases efficiently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-833",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Adding Timestamps to Transcribed Text"
