    {
      "id": "b-920",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Adding a Video Player"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-921",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Adding a video player is crucial for a complete video experience. We can leverage existing React video player components."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-922",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Implementation Plan:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-923",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Add a player component** using React Player or similar library:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-924",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```jsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-925",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import ReactPlayer from 'react-player';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-926",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// In the VideoDetailsPage component"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-927",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const [playerRef, setPlayerRef] = useState(null);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-928",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const videoUrl = useQuery(api.videos.getVideoStreamUrl, { videoId: validVideoId });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-929",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// In the JSX"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-930",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<div className=\"video-player-container\">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-931",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<ReactPlayer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-932",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "ref={setPlayerRef}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-933",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "url={videoUrl}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-934",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "controls={true}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-935",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "width=\"100%\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-936",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "height=\"100%\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-937",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "config={{"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-938",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "file: {"
